  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Common Gender  Fonds (FCG), Diakonia 2012-2013</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;rnyat st&#xf6;d till den Gemensamma fonden f&#xf6;r j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FCG &#xe4;r en gemensamma fond som f&#xf6;rvaltats av Diakonia med medel fr&#xe5;n   10 olika givare, inklusive Sverige. Projektet syftar till att         f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;trtra villkoren f&#xf6;r kvinnor i Burkina Faso och att fr&#xe4;mja        j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The FCG is a pooled fund with 10 donors promoting gender equality for development processes and programmes. By promoting the rights of      women and their participation to decision making, it is expected that poverty will be somehow alleviated in Burkina Faso (OMD 3 &amp; 1).</narrative>
  </description>
